  "updated_at": "2026-03-28",
  "bio": "Henry Lewis, based in Los Angeles, United States, is a phenomenally talented tattoo artist known for his mastery in neotraditional, trashpolka, and Japanese styles. With a firm grasp of his craft, he has managed to pull together a massive following of over 62,000 on Instagram. His motto, \"Still making things and forever breaking chains,\" mirrors his commitment to pushing the boundaries of creativity while retaining the essence of tradition. He maintains an absolute level of cleanliness which matches his impressive skill level, giving his clients both a safe and visually stunning tattoo experience.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Los Angeles, California, United States\n\nTattooer / Artist in San Francisco CA \nFOR BOOKING email me\n@lewishenry77@gmail.com\nEmail seventhsontattoo@gmail.com or call 415-551-7766  in SF",
